ps://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Elasticsearch Version\n\n9.2.0-SNAPSHOT\n\n### Installed Plugins\n\n_No response_\n\n### Java Version\n\n_bundled_\n\n### OS Version\n\nDarwin\n\n### Problem Description\n\nIf you delete an async search, the async search status endpoint does not indicate that the search request is deleted and it seems to keep running.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Submit an async search (`POST _async_search`) (for reproducing this bug, it needs to take awhile)\n2. Delete the search (`DELETE _async_search/{id}`)\n\n```\n{\n  \"acknowledged\": true\n}\n```\n\n3. Get the status (`GET _async_search/status/{id}`) \n\n```\n{\n  \"id\": \"FnIybFJmcFRjU1JTLV9RWFd1dDEwRmceOU40cFl4Mk5RZW1uSkZCYjQ4NVNNUTozNDQ5MDYw\",\n  \"is_running\": true,\n  \"is_partial\": true,\n  \"start_time_in_millis\": 1754347528891,\n  \"expiration_time_in_millis\": 1754952334175,\n  \"_shards\": {\n    \"total\": 1,\n    \"successful\": 0,\n    \"skipped\": 0,\n    \"failed\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe status is returned as if it hasn't been deleted. This is in contrast with what happens if you call `GET _async_search/{id}` directly (which correctly reports the search cannot be found, since it has been deleted):\n\n```\n{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"root_cause\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"resource_not_found_exception\",\n        \"reason\": \"FnIybFJmcFRjU1JTLV9RWFd1dDEwRmceOU40cFl4Mk5RZW1uSkZCYjQ4NVNNUTozNDQ5MDYw\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"type\": \"resource_not_found_exception\",\n    \"reason\": \"FnIybFJmcFRjU1JTLV9RWFd1dDEwRmceOU40cFl4Mk5RZW1uSkZCYjQ4NVNNUTozNDQ5MDYw\"\n  },\n  \"status\": 404\n}\n```\n\n\n\n### Logs (if relevant)\n\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"eranweiss-elastic","id":249790040,"node_id":"U_kgDODuN-WA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/249790040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic","html_url":"https://github.com/eranweiss-elastic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eranweiss-elastic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/132423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/132423/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}